{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 38, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Let us commence, then, with thy voyage to the land of rising sun, Japan. From thy port of departure, set sail and arrive at the capital, Tokyo, where the heart of the nation beats. Here, behold the grandeur of Tokyo Tower, and walk amidst the bustling metropolis, tasting the delights of sushi and sashimi.\n\nNext, journey to Kyoto, the former capital, where the spirit of old Japan lingers. Stroll through the serene gardens of Kinkaku-ji, the Temple of the Golden Pavilion, and immerse thyself in the teachings of Zen Buddhism. Attend a traditional tea ceremony, and witness the artistry and grace of this ancient ritual.\n\nVenture further to the city of Nara, where deer roam freely and the legacy of the Nara period speaks through its temples and shrines. Visit Todai-ji, and stand in awe before the Great Buddha, a testament to human endeavor and faith.\n\nThen, travel to the coastal city of Hakone, and be awed by the majestic presence of Mount Fuji. Take a boat ride on Lake Ashi, and reflect upon the beauty of the mountain's reflection in the tranquil waters.\n\nLastly, return to Tokyo, and end thy journey with a visit to the vibrant district of Shibuya. Experience the energy of the city at night, and before thy departure, purchase souvenirs to commemorate thy time in Japan.\n\nThus, let thy sojourn in Japan be a tale of wonder and delight, filled with memories to last a lifetime. And when thou returnest to thine homeland, the stories of thy adventures shall be as grand as the tales of yore.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -3.1685729026794434}, {"token": " us", "logprob": -0.8759230375289917}, {"token": " commence", "logprob": -2.306546449661255}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.2773735523223877}, {"token": " then", "logprob": -1.3407827615737915}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0012334127677604556}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.9818747